      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## About FLUX.1 [dev]\n\n[FLUX.1 [dev]](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-dev) (Black Forest Labs, 12B, CLIP-L and T5-XXL text\nencoders): text-to-image with the largest LoRA and ControlNet ecosystem after SDXL. Write full descriptive sentences;\nput literal text in quotes. There is no negative prompt: dev runs with embedded guidance (**FluxGuidance**), not true\nCFG, so never raise a real CFG above 1.\n\n**Settings**: 20 steps (28-30 for finals), guidance 3.5 (Distilled CFG in the Generate tab), euler, simple,\n1024×1024 or another ~1 MP size (multiples of 16). **Width** and **Height** feed the latent and **ModelSamplingFlux**,\nwhose shift grows with the image size.\n\n## Image Bench\n\nThe node titles carry Image Bench markers:\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed (RandomNoise), steps and scheduler (BasicScheduler), sampling method (KSamplerSelect), Distilled CFG (FluxGuidance), size (Width / Height) |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | — (LoRA exploration only) |\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list of the Generate tab, or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt.\nThe **Image Bench Prompt** node applies them and passes the prompt on without the tags.\n**Load LoRA** stays bypassed; LoRA exploration enables it for its runs and bypasses it again afterwards.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**: [flux1-dev-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/flux-fp8/resolve/main/flux1-dev-fp8.safetensors) (Kijai, fp8 e4m3fn, 12 GB;\nthe bf16 [flux1-dev.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-dev) of Black Forest Labs is gated)\n**text_encoders**: [clip_l.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/clip_l.safetensors),\n[t5xxl_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/t5xxl_fp16.safetensors)\n(or [t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors) with less memory)\n**vae**: [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Lumina_Image_2.0_Repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   └── flux1-dev-fp8.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   ├── clip_l.safetensors\n    │   └── t5xxl_fp16.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── ae.safetensors\n```\n\nFLUX.1 [dev] is under the FLUX.1 [dev] non-commercial license.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: FLUX.1 [dev]",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
